{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいでは早速"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．電車で見掛けたら声かけていいのかな？？\nＡ.もちろん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらテンション高山になるからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．最近有った嬉しい出来事と悲しい出来事を教えてくらさい\nＡ.嬉しかった事は、髪型がやけに評判良い事"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しかった事は、……ない…（笑）最近ハッピーかも\nＱ．軽く自己紹介してください\nＡ.はいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校２年１７歳"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"割とボケキャラで、年下年上皆にツッコまれてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/good.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみって呼んでね??よろしく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．パスワードとかけまして？\nＡ.パスワードとかけましてお財布"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも忘れたら大変～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．受験生の自分にエールを送ってくれますか?\nＡ.受験って本当に自分との戦いだよね。最後の最後まで諦めないで信じ続けたら絶っ対大丈夫。引き寄せの法則ですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．あみあみを応援していいですか？\nＡ.もうしてーしてー応援して下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたもあみあみ族に入りませんか?\nＱ．あみさんが思う乃木坂メンバーで歌がうまいと思うのは？\nＡ.まひろの声は本当魅力的だと思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさの声も好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．愛未ちゃんは俺みたいなやつでも好きでいてくれますか??\nＡ.もちろん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この人だから嫌いーなんて絶っ対思わない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみを応援してくれる人は皆大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．好きなアイドルグループとアイドルは？\nＡ.AKB48の大島優子さんです!本当に憧れを抱いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．今後髪型をショートにしたり茶髪にしたりしたいなって思ったことありますか？\nＡ.いつかショートにしてみたいなとはすごい思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと明るい色入れたいし☆\nＱ．愛未ちゃんに推し変してもいいかな？\nＡ.あみの事応援してくれるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいよありがと～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのかわりあみから押し変したら駄目だからね??\nＱ．どんな可愛い物まねが得意ですか？\nＡ.あみの物真似で可愛いのってあまりない気が…（笑）今いろーんなの練習中だから待っててね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/28/image0028.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問続きは明後日"}],"source":"archive"}